    "name": {
      "value": "Autumn's Embrace"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "is_core": {
      "value": false
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Woven by fey seamstresses as rewards for servants of nature, countless leaves continually changing colors in autumnal hues comprise autumn's embrace, a suit of +2 invisibility resilient leaf weave. Leaves shed from the armor as they might fall in autumn. When activating the armor's invisibility property rune, you disappear in a swirl of colorful leaves.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Traits:** aura\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou call forth a storm of leaves from autumn's embrace. These leaves swirl in a 20-foot emanation for 1 minute. Creatures within the area are concealed, and creatures outside the area are concealed to creatures within the leaves. However, you can see through this concealment. You can Dismiss the activation."
    },
